From 87a8605dbed86ceee02c558ba28e25e7bad02f0d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 15:30:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 27/39] s13d g4 cont4: factor the left layout and the pinned
 rows

The left layout is the mirror of the swapped contents' right layout
(zr_lfield, zr_lstart, read through zr_mirror_tape and zr_bufferTape_reverse);
the five re-indexed pinned rows go through one lemma (zr_pinRe_step) and the
seek family's endpoint through zr_seekPost_pin; a pin is renaming-invariant in
both directions (zr_pinned_mapState_iff).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0155fKrzMUhziJHzQxJacYbw
